    "split_route_recheck": "The split route raises the speculative arm's MTP share from 0.534 to 0.994 (+86%) but lowers its decode rate in both paired runs (-17.2% and -5.1%) and also lowers the co-resident AR arm's rate (-17.1% and -5.1%), reproducing the 2026-09-18 rejection: the extra provider cycles cost more than the AR batch decode they replace."
